"description":"Teladoc Health is the leader in virtual care. Our doctors diagnose, treat and prescribe when\nneeded. You can also use our app to help manage weight, diabetes, blood pressure and your\noverall health.\n\nOur services include:\n\n24/7 CARE\n-On-demand visits with board-certified doctors and nurse practitioners\n-Help with time-sensitive concerns like cold and flu\n-Prescriptions and limited refills\n\nPRIMARY CARE\n-Care provider who gets to know you over time\n-Annual checkups and ongoing care\n-Prescriptions, lab tests and referrals\n\nCONDITION MANAGEMENT\n-Help managing weight, blood sugar and blood pressure\n-Connected scale, blood glucose meter or blood pressure monitor\n-Tips and tools to help manage your health, including AI-powered food tracking\n-Unlimited 1:1 health coaching\n-GLP-1 support for those who qualify\n\nMENTAL HEALTH\n-Therapists, psychiatrists and coaches\n-Personalized digital program\n-Help with stress, anxiety, depression, relationships and more\n\nDERMATOLOGY\n-Photo review of skin concerns\n-Treatment plan delivered by message within 24 hours\n-Prescriptions and limited refills\n\nNUTRITION\n-Registered dietitians\n-Help with your conditions and goals\n-Personalized meal plans, grocery guides and more\n\nSEXUAL HEALTH\n-Confidential lab testing for STDs through STDcheck.com\n-Results in under three days\n\nSECOND OPINIONS\n-Expert opinions on diagnoses and care\n-Help choosing a treatment\n-Many available specialties\n\n***\n\nCare at Teladoc Health is:\n\nCOVERED BY MOST MAJOR HEALTH INSURERS\nMore than 1 in 4 Americans have Teladoc Health coverage through their employer or health\ninsurance. When you create an account, we’ll help you check if you’re covered. But coverage isn’t\nrequired. Many services are available without it.\n\nPERSONALIZED\nOur care providers get to know you and tend to every part of your well-being. We also offer digital\ntools and programs designed around your needs. You can even connect Apple Health to sync your\ndata and get health insights.\n\nCONVENIENT\nWe can address most common health needs anytime, anywhere. With some programs, you’ll get a\nblood pressure monitor, scale or blood glucose meter sent to your home. We also offer in-home\nlab services and prescription delivery in some locations. If you need in-person care, we can refer\nyou to in-network providers.\n\nHIGH-QUALITY\nTeladoc Health has been caring for people virtually for more than 20 years. More than 50 million\nvisits later, we’re the leader in virtual care. Newsweek has recognized us as one of the most\ntrustworthy companies in America. USA Today has called us one of America’s most trusted brands.\n\nPRIVATE AND SECURE\nTeladoc Health takes your privacy seriously. Your health information is protected by federal and\nstate laws, including HIPAA. View our privacy policies for more information on how Teladoc Health\nuses your personal information: https://www.teladochealth.com/legal/privacy-policy.", "userRatingCount":741666}, 
