"description":"Zocdoc is the leading healthcare app that makes it easy for you to find and book the right doctor. Each month, millions of people use Zocdoc to search for in-network care and instantly book appointments online. \n\nWhether you need a same-day appointment or want to schedule a doctor appointment online, Zocdoc makes it fast and easy. Patients typically see a doctor within 24 to 72 hours of booking. \n\nDownload the FREE Zocdoc app to find and book a doctor today.\n\nWHY PATIENTS LOVE ZOCDOC\n\nZocdoc makes it easy to go from searching to scheduling in just a few taps.\n\n- Search by your insurance and city to find in-network doctors near you\n- Browse by specialty, availability, or procedure to get the care you need\n- Filter by what matters to you: distance, gender, ratings, and more\n- Read real, verified reviews from other patients\n- See providers' real-time appointment availability\n- Easily book in-person or telehealth visits that fit your schedule\n- Get automatic reminders so you never miss an appointment\n- Fill out your forms ahead of time, so your visit starts smoothly\n\nPOPULAR CARE OPTIONS\n\nZocdoc connects patients to more than 250,000 providers across more than 200 specialties. You can book an online doctor for a virtual visit, schedule urgent care, book in-person care near you, or find providers who accept Medicare plans.\n\nLooking to schedule a dental cleaning, therapy appointment, or Rx refill? Zocdoc helps you book the appointment you need, from routine visits to specialized care.\n\nHere are just a few of the most popular services patients book through the app:\n\n- Dentist: Dental cleanings, checkups, and x-rays\n- Therapist: Therapy sessions for mental health support\n- Primary Care Doctor: Annual checkups and physicals\n- OB-GYN: Pap smears and women’s health visits\n- Dermatologist: Skin checks and acne consultations\n- Psychiatrist: Medication management and evaluations\n- Pediatrician: Wellness visits and sick appointments for kids\n- Eye Doctor: Vision exams and prescription updates\n- Orthopedic Specialist: Joint pain, injuries, and sports medicine\n- Cardiologist: Heart health screenings and follow-ups\n\nThere are many more specialties and procedures you can book with Zocdoc. Your healthcare, on your terms.\n\nINSURANCE PLANS ACCEPTED\n\nZocdoc makes it easy to find doctors who accept your insurance, with no phone calls or guesswork required. Here are some of the most commonly accepted insurance plans on Zocdoc.\n\n- Cigna\n- UnitedHealthcare\n- Aetna\n- Kaiser Permanente\n- Blue Cross Blue Shield\n- Anthem\n- Humana\n- Oscar Health\n- Molina Healthcare\n- Healthfirst\n\nDoctors on Zocdoc accept nearly 20,000 different insurance plans, making it easy to find in-network care. No matter what plan you have, Zocdoc helps you see what's in-network and book care confidently.\n\nHOW TO BOOK AND MANAGE CARE WITH ZOCDOC\n\nSearch and compare.\nSearch by specialty or symptom, along with location, availability, and insurance, to see providers who are in-network. Research and compare providers by reviewing their profiles, which include professional statements, education background, photos, and verified reviews and ratings from other patients.\n\nInstantly book.\nView providers’ real-time appointment availability, select a convenient time, and click to instantly book an appointment, 24/7.\n\nPrepare for your appointment.\nSave time by filling out intake forms and insurance information on Zocdoc ahead of the visit.\n\nStay on top of your healthcare.\nKeep track of upcoming visits with appointment reminders and personalized recommendations for preventive care. View your care team and easily rebook.\n\nFrom search to follow-up, Zocdoc makes it simple to manage your care from one place.", "userRatingCount":184072}]
